# Normalize all text files to LF on checkout and commit so `dart format`
# output is identical across Windows / Linux / macOS and CI never loops on
# CRLF. See AGENTS.md ("Pinned toolchain" / CI renormalize steps).
# 所有文本文件在 checkout/commit 时统一为 LF，确保 Windows/Linux/macOS 与
# CI 的 `dart format` 输出一致、永不因 CRLF 循环。见 AGENTS.md。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files must keep CRLF to run under cmd.exe.
# Windows 批处理文件必须保持 CRLF 才能在 cmd.exe 下运行。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
